note as BIZ_diagram_42_payments
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  A provider-agnostic payment layer supporting multiple gateways (card, wallet, bank
  transfer, local rails). Tokenized payment methods (never raw PAN), payment intents
  tied to invoices/bookings/ad spend, gateway transactions with authorize/capture,
  refunds, disputes/chargebacks, scheduled payouts to practitioners (CU-18), gateway
  settlements and signed webhook events. Posts to the general ledger (module 16) and
  reconciles against billing (module 17) — money never lives only in the gateway.
end note

