end note

note as REC_PAYMENTS_diagram_42_payments
  MONEY INTEGRITY
  Never store raw card data — only gateway_token (PCI scope minimized). Every
  successful transaction/refund/payout/settlement posts to accounting via
  journal_transaction_id (double-entry) and reconciles to billing. idempotency_key on
  payment_intents prevents double charges; payment_webhook_events is append-only and
  verified by signature before processing. (owner_type,owner_ref_id) /
  (source_type,source_ref_id) / (payee_type,payee_ref_id) are polymorphic — constrain
  via value_set.
end note

