note as BIZ_diagram_42b_payments_advanced
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Turns the base gateway layer (module 42) into a marketplace-grade money platform of
  the kind a Delivery-Hero-style operator expects. Adds ledgered wallets and balances,
  multi-party split payments and connected-account payouts, subscriptions/plans and
  installment schedules, direct-debit/card mandates, tips and dynamic fee breakdowns,
  FX rate locks, risk/fraud scoring and 3-D Secure, KYC/onboarding for payees, and a
  full reconciliation engine (gateway vs ledger vs bank). Every movement double-posts
  to accounting (module 16); the wallet ledger is append-only truth for balances.
end note





