note as REC_DERIVED_diagram_42b_payments_advanced
  REC 3.3 — DERIVED BALANCES
  wallets.available_balance/pending_balance/reserved_balance are DERIVED projections of
  the append-only wallet_ledger_entries (source of truth); maintain by trigger with
  balance_after and reconcile. installment_schedules.paid_amount and reconciliation totals
  are derived. Every wallet movement double-posts to accounting via journal_transaction_id.
end note

note as HARDENING_diagram_42b_payments_advanced
  REC 3.4 — HARDENING (enforce at DDL)
  - wallet_ledger_entries: append-only; UNIQUE(idempotency_key); PARTITION BY recorded_at;
    index (wallet_id, recorded_at DESC); CHECK amount > 0.
  - wallets: UNIQUE(owner_type_concept_id, owner_ref_id, currency_concept_id, wallet_type_concept_id);
    CHECK balances >= 0 unless overdraft wallet_type.
  - payment_splits: CHECK SUM(amount) per payment_intent <= captured amount (trigger).
  - subscriptions: partial UNIQUE(subscriber_type, subscriber_ref_id, plan_id) WHERE status='active'.
  - installment_schedules: UNIQUE(installment_plan_id, sequence_no); CHECK paid_amount <= amount.
  - payment_mandates: UNIQUE(mandate_ref); risk_assessments: CHECK risk_score BETWEEN 0 AND 1000.
end note

