note right of payment_debts
  LIBELULA-STYLE DEBT FLOW
  Internal debt -> provider registration -> external transaction/checkout URL -> callback
  -> independent status inquiry -> canonical transaction -> receipt/invoice -> reconciliation.
end note

note right of provider_callback_events
  TRUST BOUNDARY
  A redirect or callback never marks a debt as paid by itself. The event is authenticated,
  deduplicated and confirmed through provider status/reconciliation before accounting effects.
end note

note right of provider_api_attempts
  Secrets and full sensitive payloads remain in a credential vault or encrypted object store.
  This log retains hashes, redacted fields, correlation and deterministic retry evidence.
end note

